      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners frequently express high satisfaction with Dr. Christian Perales and the clinic staff, praising their warm demeanor, thorough examinations, and attentive follow-up care. Reviewers emphasize that the team treats pets with genuine affection and takes time to answer questions thoroughly."
