        "en": "Gentle handling for dogs and cats"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently point out how sweet and patient the veterinarians and technicians are with their animals. Reviewers note that both dogs and cats feel at ease during routine examinations, shots, and diagnostic checkups. Many longtime owners appreciate that the clinic team consistently treats their pets like family."
      }
    },
    {
